acilities and vibrant atmosphere, fostering a sense of community and connection.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1227,"cta":{"id":1993,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/map_19c54e9d62.jpg","hash":"map_19c54e9d62","name":"Vega Residence by Acube Developments Location"},"style":null,"title":"Vibrant Living, Unmatched Views – Your serene escape in the heart of Dubai Sports City.","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Vega Residence at Dubai Sports City offers a prime location surrounded by lush greenery and panoramic views of the golf course. This elevated development is ideally situated in the heart of Dubai Sports City, providing residents with a tranquil yet vibrant living experience. With its modern architecture and premium amenities, Vega Residence ensures a sophisticated lifestyle. Acube Developments has designed the Vega Residence Master Plan to offer both luxury and convenience, making it the perfect choice for those seeking luxury apartments in Dubai Sports City.</p><ul><li>The Els Golf Club - 2 Minutes</li><li>Dubai International Stadium - 5 Minutes</li><li>Dubai Miracle Garden - 10 Minutes</li><li>Dubai Marina - 15 Minutes</li><li>Downtown Dubai - 20 Minutes</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3402,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/vega_residence_brochure_c9641d4a6e.pdf","hash":"vega_residence_brochure_c9641d4a6e","name":"Vega Residence Brochure PDF"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":null,"floor_plans":[{"id":2999,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"405 sq. ft.","media":{"url":"h