null},{"id":19039,"url":null,"text":"Outdoor Cinema","type":null,"image":null},{"id":19040,"url":null,"text":"Pilates Room","type":null,"image":null},{"id":19041,"url":null,"text":"Spa, Sky Pool ","type":null,"image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":1066,"pf_id":"are.2.14862","source":null,"project_id":"Vega Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Vega Residence","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Acube Developments","project_location":"Dubai Sports City"},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/spons_mob_61e640b716.jpg","hash":"spons_mob_61e640b716","name":"Vega Residence by Acube Developments"},"seo":{"id":1421,"metaTitle":"Vega Residence by Acube Developments at Dubai Sports City","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Explore luxury studio to 3-bedroom apartments at Vega Residence in Dubai Sports City. Fully equipped smart homes with world-class amenities and stunning views."},"more_info":[{"id":4047,"answer":"<p>Vega Residence by Acube Developments offers a selection of luxurious apartments, all featuring smart home systems and spacious layouts:</p><p>Studio from 405 sq. ft. to 515 Sq. ft. | 35 Units | AED 719K up to 823 K<br>1 - Bedroom Apartment from 740 Sq. ft. to 815 Sq. ft. | 39 Units | AED 1.14 M up to 1.33 M<br>2 - Bedroom from Apartment 1,047 sq. ft. to 1,180 Sq. ft. | 52 Units | AED 1.53 M up to 1.72 M<br>3 - Bedroom from Apartment 1,455 sq. ft. | 05 Units | AED 2.23 M</p>","question":"What types of apartments are available at Vega Residence?"},{"id":4048,"answer":"<p>Vega Residence Amenities include over 35 features, such as a net cricket court, pickleball court, kids' play area, spa, Pilates room, and sky pool, designed to promote an active and relaxed lifestyle.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are available at Vega Residence?"},{"id":4049,"answer":"<p>The Vega Residence Location in Dubai Sports City provides panoramic views of the golf course and city. Surrounded by world-class sports facilities, it offers both tranquility and easy access to key attractions in Dubai.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the location of Vega Residence?"},{"id":4050,"answer":"<p>Here’s a simpler breakdown of the payment plan for Vega Residence:</p><p>20% Down Payment: Pay 20% of the total price upfront when booking.<br>1% Per Month for 25 Months: Pay 1% of the total price monthly for the next 25 months.<br>5% in Three Installments: Pay 5% in three separate installments on specific dates: July 2025, February 2026, and September 2026.<br>1% Per Month for 35 Months During Construction: Continue with monthly payments of 1% for 35 months while construction progresses.<br>5% Pre-Handover: Pay 5% just before the property is handed over to you.<br>40% on Completion: Settle the remaining 40% upon project completion.</p>","question":"What payment plan is offered for Vega Residence?"},{"id":4051,"answer":"<p>Vega Residence is scheduled for completion by Q2 2027, providing ample time for buyers to secure their homes in this exceptional development.</p>","question":"When will the Vega Residence be completed?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":"Future Launch","adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":null,"src_cftle":"i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.webp","format":"webp","transform":"340x","created_at":"2025-08-26 15:11:19.440","updated_at":"2025-08-27 02:18:19.016"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1504x/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.webp","format":"webp","transform":"1504x","created_at":"2025-08-26 15:11:19.440","updated_at":"2025-08-27 02:18:19.016"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1504x/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","format":"png","transform":"1504x","created_at":"2024-06-19 09:14:46.636","updated_at":"2025-08-27 02:18:19.016"},{"url":"http